{"26:1:1":"Ṭâʼ Sîn Mîm","26:2:1":"Ceux-ci","26:2:2":"(sont Les) Versets","26:2:3":"(du) Livre","26:2:4":"clair.","26:3:1":"Peut-être que tu","26:3:2":"(voudrais être) quelqu’un qui t’égorge","26:3:3":"toi-même","26:3:4":"(parce) que ne pas","26:3:5":"ils sont","26:3:6":"croyants.","26:4:1":"Si","26:4:2":"Nous voulions,","26:4:3":"Nous ferions descendre","26:4:4":"à eux","26:4:5":"du","26:4:6":"[le] ciel","26:4:7":"un signe","26:4:8":"et deviendraient ensuite de jour","26:4:9":"leurs cous","26:4:10":"à lui","26:4:11":"humbles au point de se rabaisser.","26:5:1":"Et ne","26:5:2":"leur vient (pas)","26:5:3":"de","26:5:4":"rappel","26:5:5":"de","26:5:6":"L’Extrêmement Miséricordieux en Son Essence","26:5:7":"produit de manière nouvelle","26:5:8":"sans qu’","26:5:9":"ils soient","26:5:10":"de lui","26:5:11":"des gens qui se détournent.","26:6:1":"Donc certes,","26:6:2":"ils ont démenti,","26:6:3":"leur viendront donc certainement très bientôt","26:6:4":"(les) informations","26:6:5":"(de) ce dont","26:6:6":"ils se moquaient","26:6:7":"(de) lui","26:6:8":"ils se moquaient.","26:7:1":"Et est-ce que ne pas","26:7:2":"ils ont regardé","26:7:3":"vers","26:7:4":"la terre :","26:7:5":"combien","26:7:6":"Nous avons fait pousser","26:7:7":"en elle","26:7:8":"de","26:7:9":"chaque","26:7:10":"type","26:7:11":"honorable ?","26:8:1":"Certes,","26:8:2":"(il y a) en","26:8:3":"cela","26:8:4":"certainement un signe","26:8:5":"mais ne","26:8:6":"sont (pas)","26:8:7":"(la) plupart (d’)eux","26:8:8":"croyants.","26:9:1":"Et certes,","26:9:2":"ton Maître (est)","26:9:3":"certainement Lui","26:9:4":"Le Parfaitement Fort,","26:9:5":"Le Très Miséricordieux.","26:10:1":"Et quand","26:10:2":"a appelé","26:10:3":"ton Maître","26:10:4":"Moïse","26:10:5":"que :","26:10:6":"« Va","26:10:7":"(vers) les gens","26:10:8":"injustes,","26:11:1":"(les) gens","26:11:2":"(de) Pharaon !","26:11:3":"Est-ce que ne pas","26:11:4":"ils craindront avec piété ? »","26:12:1":"Il a dit :","26:12:2":"« Mon Maître !","26:12:3":"Certes, j’","26:12:4":"ai peur","26:12:5":"qu’","26:12:6":"ils me démentiront","26:13:1":"et est étroite","26:13:2":"ma poitrine","26:13:3":"et ne","26:13:4":"s’exprime (pas) bien","26:13:5":"ma langue,","26:13:6":"envoie donc","26:13:7":"vers","26:13:8":"Aaron.","26:14:1":"Et (il y a) à eux","26:14:2":"contre moi","26:14:3":"un crime","26:14:4":"et j’ai peur","26:14:5":"qu’","26:14:6":"ils me tueront. »","26:15:1":"Il a dit :","26:15:2":"« Non, pas du tout !","26:15:3":"Partez donc tous deux","26:15:4":"avec Nos signes.","26:15:5":"Certes, nous (sommes)","26:15:6":"avec vous","26:15:7":"des Entendeurs Attentifs.","26:16:1":"Allez donc","26:16:2":"(vers) Pharaon","26:16:3":"et dites ensuite :","26:16:4":"“Certes, nous","26:16:5":"(sommes Le) Messager","26:16:6":"(du) Maître","26:16:7":"(de) toutes les générations de chaque créature","26:17:1":"que :","26:17:2":"“Envoie","26:17:3":"avec nous","26:17:4":"(les) fils","26:17:5":"(d’)Israël”” »","26:18:1":"Il a dit :","26:18:2":"« Est-ce que ne pas","26:18:3":"nous t’avons élevé","26:18:4":"parmi nous","26:18:5":"(dans l’état où tu étais) un enfant","26:18:6":"et tu es resté","26:18:7":"parmi nous","26:18:8":"de","26:18:9":"ta période de vie","26:18:10":"(pendant) des années ?","26:19:1":"Et tu as fait","26:19:2":"ton action","26:19:3":"que","26:19:4":"tu as faite","26:19:5":"alors que tu (étais)","26:19:6":"parmi","26:19:7":"les ingrats. »","26:20:1":"Il a dit :","26:20:2":"« Je l’ai faite","26:20:3":"alors","26:20:4":"dans l’état où j’(étais)","26:20:5":"parmi","26:20:6":"les égarés","26:21:1":"et je me suis ensuite enfui","26:21:2":"de vous","26:21:3":"quand","26:21:4":"j’ai eu peur (de) vous","26:21:5":"et a ensuite offert","26:21:6":"à moi","26:21:7":"mon Maître","26:21:8":"de la sagesse","26:21:9":"et m’a fait","26:21:10":"parmi","26:21:11":"Les Messagers.","26:22:1":"Et cela","26:22:2":"(est) un bienfait","26:22:3":"(qui) tu as fait faveur (de) lui","26:22:4":"à moi :","26:22:5":"que","26:22:6":"tu as transformé en esclaves","26:22:7":"(les) fils","26:22:8":"(d’)Israël ! »","26:23:1":"A dit","26:23:2":"Pharaon :","26:23:3":"« Et qu’est-ce qui (est)","26:23:4":"(Le) Maître","26:23:5":"(de) toutes les générations de chaque créature ? »","26:24:1":"Il a dit :","26:24:2":"« (Le) Maître","26:24:3":"(des) cieux","26:24:4":"et (de) la terre","26:24:5":"et ce qui (est)","26:24:6":"entre eux deux,","26:24:7":"si","26:24:8":"vous êtes","26:24:9":"des gens qui ont la certitude. »","26:25:1":"Il a dit","26:25:2":"à quiconque","26:25:3":"(était) autour (de) lui :","26:25:4":"« Est-ce que ne pas","26:25:5":"vous écoutez attentivement ? »","26:26:1":"Il a dit :","26:26:2":"« Votre Maître","26:26:3":"et (Le) Maître","26:26:4":"(de) vos ancêtres","26:26:5":"premiers. »","26:27:1":"Il a dit :","26:27:2":"« Certes,","26:27:3":"votre Messager","26:27:4":"qui","26:27:5":"a été envoyé","26:27:6":"vers vous (est)","26:27:7":"certainement fou ! »","26:28:1":"Il a dit :","26:28:2":"« (Le) Maître","26:28:3":"(de) l’est","26:28:4":"et (de) l’ouest","26:28:5":"et (de) ce qui","26:28:6":"(est) entre eux deux,","26:28:7":"si","26:28:8":"vous raisonniez","26:28:9":"vous raisonniez. »","26:29:1":"Il a dit :","26:29:2":"« Certainement si","26:29:3":"tu prends","26:29:4":"un dieu","26:29:5":"autre (que) moi,","26:29:6":"je te ferai très certainement","26:29:7":"parmi","26:29:8":"les prisonniers ! »","26:30:1":"Il a dit :","26:30:2":"« Est-ce que même si","26:30:3":"je t’apportais","26:30:4":"[] une chose","26:30:5":"claire ? »","26:31:1":"Il a dit :","26:31:2":"« Alors amène","26:31:3":"[] la","26:31:4":"si","26:31:5":"tu es","26:31:6":"parmi","26:31:7":"les véridiques. »","26:32:1":"Il a donc jeté","26:32:2":"son bâton de berger","26:32:3":"et alors","26:32:4":"il (est devenu)","26:32:5":"un serpent mâle","26:32:6":"clair.","26:33:1":"Et il a enlevé","26:33:2":"sa main","26:33:3":"et alors","26:33:4":"elle (est devenue)","26:33:5":"blanche","26:33:6":"pour les observateurs.","26:34:1":"Il a dit","26:34:2":"aux notables","26:34:3":"autour (de) lui :","26:34:4":"« Certes,","26:34:5":"celui-ci (est)","26:34:6":"certainement un magicien","26:34:7":"très savant","26:35:1":"(qui) veut","26:35:2":"qu’","26:35:3":"il vous sorte","26:35:4":"de","26:35:5":"votre territoire","26:35:6":"avec sa magie,","26:35:7":"donc qu’est-ce que","26:35:8":"vous ordonnez ? »","26:36:1":"Ils ont dit :","26:36:2":"« Fais-le attendre","26:36:3":"et son frère","26:36:4":"et envoie","26:36:5":"dans","26:36:6":"les villes","26:36:7":"des assembleurs","26:37:1":"(qui) t’amèneront","26:37:2":"[] chaque","26:37:3":"grand magicien","26:37:4":"très savant. »","26:38:1":"Ont donc été assemblés","26:38:2":"les magiciens","26:38:3":"pour (le) temps fixé","26:38:4":"(d’)un jour","26:38:5":"connu.","26:39:1":"Et il a été dit","26:39:2":"aux gens :","26:39:3":"« Est-ce que","26:39:4":"vous (serez)","26:39:5":"assemblés","26:40:1":"afin que nous","26:40:2":"suivrons","26:40:3":"les magiciens","26:40:4":"s’","26:40:5":"ils seront","26:40:6":"eux","26:40:7":"les gens qui surpassent ? »","26:41:1":"Et ensuite, quand","26:41:2":"sont arrivés","26:41:3":"les magiciens,","26:41:4":"ils ont dit","26:41:5":"à Pharaon :","26:41:6":"« Est-ce que certes","26:41:7":"(il y aura) pour nous","26:41:8":"certainement une compensation","26:41:9":"si","26:41:10":"nous sommes","26:41:11":"nous","26:41:12":"les gens qui surpassent ? »","26:42:1":"Il a dit :","26:42:2":"« Oui !","26:42:3":"Et certes, vous (serez)","26:42:4":"alors","26:42:5":"parmi","26:42:6":"les gens rapprochés. »","26:43:1":"A dit","26:43:2":"à eux","26:43:3":"Moïse :","26:43:4":"« Jetez","26:43:5":"ce dont","26:43:6":"vous (êtes)","26:43:7":"des gens qui jettent ! »","26:44:1":"Et ils ont ensuite jeté","26:44:2":"leurs cordes","26:44:3":"et leurs bâtons de berger","26:44:4":"et ont dit :","26:44:5":"« Par (la) force","26:44:6":"(de) Pharaon !","26:44:7":"Certes, nous (serons)","26:44:8":"certainement nous","26:44:9":"les gens qui surpassent ! »","26:45: